    "title": "Upcoming November Weekend Closures: SR 12 Rio Vista Bridge to Close for Repairs - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago Caltrans will close the SR 12 Rio Vista Bridge for 55 hours on two weekends in November 2025. The closures will allow crews to fix damage at the bridge’s east end caused by a vehicle crash. The bridge will be closed from 9 p.m. Friday, November 7 to 4 a.m. Monday, November 10. It will close again from 9 p.m. Friday, November 14 to 4 a.m. Monday, November 17.\nDrivers should visit www.bit.ly/CTDeltaRegion for updates or changes to the schedule. The repairs are needed to keep the bridge safe for use.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
